{"data":{"body":"[P2] Do not let optional trace capture abort durable execution. `getMethod()` or `getXrayTraceId()` can throw a `SecurityException` or another runtime exception, which escapes this catch before the handler starts; `DurableExecutor` even calls it when no plugins are registered. Treat non-fatal accessor failures as an unavailable header, skip capture when the plugin runner is empty, and add a throwing-context regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc75wuyV","finding_digest":"4efce7f65a7b09127f704cf2ffb1e26d4c6da17079ae8f2820c1e5d19b022013","finding_id":"arf_v1_j36op5s2pmere73qjtzp7mpcnv","finding_key":"sdk/execution/runtimetraceheader::capture::optional-failure-isolation","identity_key":"sdk/execution/runtimetraceheader::capture::optional-failure-isolation","line":28,"observation_digest":"e944e2851019f40b4d6cd0d2d7952156fc1d44833d1f132713d6e73800623614","observation_id":"aro_v1_5fcofbiqdh2awtlm2djnpfjbk3","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/RuntimeTraceHeader.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-06T00:31:39Z","review_id":"arr_v1_jzacycden5kk7lr6qy5sa4pa6o","reviewed_base_sha":"ac6a6f5ea50d6a9098b716905f01c609e4c201ae","reviewed_head_sha":"4c725abd5938dc4f7ff067ecb044246f7945b4f7","reviewer":"codex","start_line":28,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":765},"record_id":"art_v1_yqldrw5o2j6gph3f7mr56rv6oc","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-06T00:31:39Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
